Skill `sandbox-next`.
Roles: `agent`.
Tool `inspect_project_line` (owner `agent`): via `read`; adds `project_inspected`.
Tool `inspect_next_types_and_examples` (owner `agent`): via `read`; requires `project_inspected`; adds `local_refs_checked`.
Tool `fetch_preview_docs` (owner `agent`): via `web_fetch`; requires `project_inspected`; needs `allowlisted_internet`; adds `preview_docs_checked`.
Tool `implement_or_update_next_code` (owner `agent`): via `edit`; requires (`project_inspected` and `local_refs_checked` and `preview_docs_checked` and `is_next_project`); adds `next_code_updated`.
Tool `align_lockfile_and_dockerfile` (owner `agent`): via `edit`; requires (`project_inspected` and `is_next_project`); adds `line_alignment_updated`.
Tool `typecheck_next_project` (owner `agent`): via `bash`; requires (`is_next_project` and `next_code_updated`); needs `shell`, `linux`, `package_registries`; adds `typecheck_passed`.
Tool `reply_next_done` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires (`is_next_project` and `next_code_updated` and `typecheck_passed`); adds `skill_done`.
Tool `reply_use_stable_skill` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires (`project_inspected` and `is_stable_project`); adds `skill_done`.
Tool `reply_use_migration_skill` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires (`project_inspected` and `is_port_request`); adds `skill_done`.
Tool `reply_bridge_stays_stable` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires (`project_inspected` and `is_bridge_only_project`); adds `skill_done`.
Initially true: none.
Goal: `skill_done`.
Protocol:
  - `agent` uses `inspect_project_line`.
  - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
    - branch `port_to_next` (assuming `is_port_request`):
      - `agent` uses `reply_use_migration_skill`.
    - branch `stable_package` (assuming `is_stable_project`):
      - `agent` uses `reply_use_stable_skill`.
    - branch `bridge_only` (assuming `is_bridge_only_project`):
      - `agent` uses `reply_bridge_stays_stable`.
    - branch `next_project` (assuming `is_next_project`):
      - `agent` uses `inspect_next_types_and_examples`.
      - `agent` uses `fetch_preview_docs`.
      - `agent` uses `implement_or_update_next_code`.
      - `agent` uses `align_lockfile_and_dockerfile`.
      - `agent` uses `typecheck_next_project`.
      - `agent` uses `reply_next_done`.
